blished primary outcome; no major switch is inferred from the lack of historical versions.",high,True,False,False,False,,0.97,Concordant (no change),clinically equivalent,"Progression-free survival (PFS), reported primarily as median PFS by treatment group",,True,,"[{""registered_endpoint"": ""Progression-free Survival"", ""published_corresponding_endpoint"": ""Progression-free survival, reported as median PFS and hazard-ratio comparisons"", ""same_construct"": true, ""same_timeframe"": null, ""same_definition"": null, ""same_population"": null, ""same_measurement_method"": null, ""registered_endpoint_reported"": true, ""additional_endpoint_present"": false, ""additional_endpoint_disclosed"": false, ""change_disclosed"": null, ""actual_change_evidence"": [], ""classification_label"": ""Concordant (no change)""}]",auto_accepted,confirm,concordant,True,,AUTO,,pipeline_v4.5,2026-09-05T21:35:55.814690+00:00
