nt_disclosed"": false, ""change_disclosed"": null, ""actual_change_evidence"": [""The current registry lists the primary outcome broadly as RCB Status, whereas the publication explicitly identifies the primary endpoint/design target as pCR/RCB-I."", ""The publication reports RCB categories and pCR results, but evaluates the favorable outcome using the pCR/RCB-I threshold rather than RCB status as an unrestricted categorical endpoint.""], ""classification_label"": ""Outcome modification (timeframe/definition/population)""}]",auto_accepted,confirm,minor_modification,False,,AUTO,,pipeline_v4.5,2026-09-06T02:53:57.617148+00:00
